      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"goblins\" in this context? I was looking for a strictly biochemical explanation for my thesis. Can you please strip away the metaphors and just explain the deprotonation process and the resulting nucleophilicity of the nitrogen atom more clearly without the analogies?",
      "source": "evaluator"
